# Anvilhold distant shot

When you finish a pass that changes Anvilhold / `ashen_bastion` (SDF kit, BAM, heightfield, props, or courtyard layout):

1. Follow `docs/maps/anvilhold-castle/SHOT.md` exactly (same URL, zoom **0.15**, camera **(0, 2158)**).
2. Save `docs/maps/anvilhold-castle/distant-overview.png` and a stamped copy under `docs/maps/anvilhold-castle/passes/`.
3. Also copy to `/opt/cursor/artifacts/anvilhold-distant-overview.png`.
4. Include the latest distant overview image in your reply to the user.

Do not invent a new camera angle for progress shots.
